        "original_id": "db3639dc-4557-5271-8fff-d1adbbbbbef3",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Dan Balan, T.I., Rihanna, Radu Sîrbu, Arsenie Todiraș\n- Groups: O-Zone\n- Songs/Albums: \"Live Your Life\", Paper Trail\n\nFacts:\n- O-Zone was a Moldovan pop music trio active from 1998 to 2005.\n- O-Zone consisted of Dan Balan, Radu Sîrbu, and Arsenie Todiraș.\n- \"Live Your Life\" is a song by American rapper T.I. from his 2008 sixth studio album, Paper Trail, and it features Barbadian singer Rihanna.\n- Dan Balan was nominated for a Grammy as a co-writer of Rihanna and T.I.'s \"Live Your Life.\"\n- Dan Balan is the first and only Moldovan musician to receive a Grammy nomination.",
